nent to coordinate several sections;\nin that composition, manage expansion through the group."},"436":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-32","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Use `className` and `style` to customize each component. Button supports string or state-based\n`className` values. Components expose these data attributes for state-based styling:"},"437":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-33","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"`Collapsible`: `data-expanded`, `data-disabled`, and `data-focus-visible-within`."},"438":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-34","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Trigger `Button`: `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, and `data-disabled`."},"439":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-35","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"`CollapsiblePanel`: `data-focus-visible-within`."},"440":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-36","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"Key"},"441":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-37","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"Action"},"442":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-38","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"`Tab` / `Shift + Tab`"},"443":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-39","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"Move between the enabled trigger and controls in the expanded panel"},"444":{"id":"/doc