gnment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[769,"**DOM Output:**"],[1801,"**End**"],[714,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1728,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[785,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[773,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[758,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[707,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1399,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[761,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1915,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1927,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1799,"**Home**"],[1930,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1919,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[2109,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[2100,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[736,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[776,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[1893,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart posi