r most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[771,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[766,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[1891,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[1928,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1820,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[1896,"**RTL support*&#x2A;: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences &#x2A;(in development)*"],[1926,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[1923,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1359,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1360,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1449,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[293,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[1957,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[1889,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1395,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[875,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[485,"**Sizes**: Each picker is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, trigger, description,